"chunk plan, including the complete 1,273-line filing projection contract "
"and 731-line JSON output contract. The report describes the checked-in "
"snapshot only. I did not import application code, run the application or "
"tests, contact Google or AEAT, or verify external tax rules and portal "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
